        "zh-Hans": "设 log 表示常用对数。方程 x^(log x) = 10^6 x 的所有正实数解是哪一组？",
        "en": "Let log denote the common logarithm. Which pair gives all positive real solutions of x^(log x) = 10^6 x?",
        "ja": "log を常用対数とします。方程式 x^(log x) = 10^6 x の正の実数解をすべて含む組はどれですか。"
      },
      "answer": {
        "zh-Hant": "答案是 10^3 與 10^-2。",
        "zh-Hans": "答案是 10^3 与 10^-2。",
        "en": "The answer is 10^3 and 10^-2.",
        "ja": "答えは 10^3 と 10^-2 です。"
      },
      "solutionSteps": {
        "zh-Hant": ["兩邊取常用對數，得 log(x^(log x)) = log(10^6 x)。", "左邊化為 (log x)^2，右邊化為 6 + log x。", "所以 (log x)^2 - log x - 6 = 0。", "因式分解得 (log x - 3)(log x + 2) = 0。", "因此 log x = 3 或 -2，所以 x = 10^3 或 10^-2。"],
        "zh-Hans": ["两边取常用对数，得 log(x^(log x)) = log(10^6 x)。", "左边化为 (log x)^2，右边化为 6 + log x。", "所以 (log x)^2 - log x - 6 = 0。", "因式分解得 (log x - 3)(log x + 2) = 0。", "因此 log x = 3 或 -2，所以 x = 10^3 或 10^-2。"],
        "en": ["Take common logs of both sides: log(x^(log x)) = log(10^6 x).", "This becomes (log x)^2 = 6 + log x.", "So (log x)^2 - log x - 6 = 0.", "Factor to get (log x - 3)(log x + 2) = 0.", "Hence log x = 3 or -2, giving x = 10^3 or 10^-2."],
        "ja": ["両辺の常用対数を取ると log(x^(log x)) = log(10^6 x)。", "左辺は (log x)^2、右辺は 6 + log x。", "したがって (log x)^2 - log x - 6 = 0。", "これは (log x - 3)(log x + 2) = 0 と因数分解できます。", "よって x = 10^3 または 10^-2。"]
      },
      "figure": { "type": "custom", "kind": "none", "params": {} },
